{
 "_doc": "Household default channel list for a TV that is not signed in (spec/apps.md 'Kanály' → 'Household default (T11)'). State: own (the TV's list is its own), local (the TV's stored prefs, a label), default (the household default from the gateway, a label or null) and version. effective = own ? local : (default ?? 'builtin'). Events: defaults (GET /dvb/defaults; applied only when version is newer; null channelPrefs = no default), change (the viewer changed the list; settings = the new list), reset (Obnovit výchozí). migrate: a TV with stored prefs from before T11.",
